[[Luxon Soldier]]s are allies that help you battle the [[Afflicted]] during [[the Eternal Grove]] and [[Gyala Hatchery]].

==Missions==
*[[Echovald Forest]]
**{{NPC location|The Eternal Grove}} (Ranger only)
*[[The Jade Sea]]
**{{NPC location|Gyala Hatchery}} ([[spawn]]s at the end along with the Afflicted)

==Skills==
===Ranger===
*{{skill icon|Disrupting Lunge}}
*{{skill icon|Heal as One}} ([[elite]])
*{{skill icon|Pounce}}
*{{skill icon|Run as One}}
*{{monster skill icon|Charm Animal (monster skill)}}

===Necromancer===
*{{skill icon|Lingering Curse}} (elite)
*{{skill icon|Suffering}}
*{{skill icon|Well of the Profane}}

==Notes==
*Has the same skills as [[Luxon Ranger]]s and [[Luxon Necromancer]]s.
*In the Eternal Grove, Luxon Soldiers are accompanied by an Elder [[Reef Lurker]].
{{anomaly|In Gyala Hatchery, the Ranger Luxon Soldiers are unable to use their pet attacks as they don't have a pet. They're still able to use Heal as One and Run As One.}}
